    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d877-a1">

                <pb facs="1050" n="1040" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg1040"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Norwegian Embassy to the
                            Treasury Department
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum</hi>
                </p>
                <p>With further reference to conversations regarding use of Norwegian currency
                    during invasion of Norway by Allied expeditionary forces (Memoranda by
                    representatives of the Norwegian Embassy, dated March 30 and June 5, 1943<anchor
                        n="19" xml:id="d877-f1"/>) the Norwegian Embassy have now received a further
                    communication from the Norwegian Ministry of Finance in London, stating that so
                    far no formal agreement has been concluded between British and Norwegian
                    authorities. It is understood that such agreement would need the acquiescence of
                    the proper American authorities.</p>
                <p>During the conversations which have taken place in London the British Treasury
                    have stated that they agree to use Norwegian currency during the invasion and
                    that they would have no objection to an exchange rate of 20 Norwegian kroner to
                    1 pound sterling.</p>
                <p>The Norwegian Embassy venture to hope that the American authorities will see
                    their way to take the same standpoint in these matters as those expressed by the
                    British.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-06-24">June 24,
                    1943</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
